From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: metaX contributors
Subject: [PATCH] avbase: require exact normalized work identity in search

AVBase search is fuzzy. Try the original, compact, and dashed query forms,
then accept only candidates whose work_id matches the requested catalog
number after separator/case/leading-zero normalization. Resolve duplicate
work IDs deterministically: prefer a work whose products contain the number,
otherwise prefer a unique unprefixed work; return no result for unresolved
ambiguity. Keep the existing source-provider metadata lookup unchanged.

Based on metatube-community/metatube-sdk-go commit
c62584675c593816cc07e7b5b977d14c7eb505a3.

---
